  "description": "A comprehensive, SARS-compliant South African tax calculation library supporting PAYE, UIF, SDL, ETI and complete payslip calculations for tax years 2023-2026. Fully compliant with official SARS legislation, Fourth Schedule Income Tax Act, and Employment Tax Incentive Act requirements. Features 98.63% test coverage with 283 comprehensive tests ensuring calculation accuracy and reliability. \n\nDISCLAIMER: This software is provided for informational and educational purposes only. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy and compliance with SARS regulations, the author makes no warranties or guarantees regarding the correctness, completeness, or reliability of the calculations. Users are solely responsible for verifying all calculations and ensuring compliance with current tax regulations. The author shall not be held liable for any errors, omissions, or damages arising from the use of this software. Always consult with qualified tax professionals for official tax advice.",
